 "text": "Hello, how are things going? That's doable with a car ticket. You can park near the trailhead and easily walk back to the car for the pillow. Got it. One way ticket, park near the trailhead, and plan to walk back. Much better, thank you very much. The quick way in is from the main road, right by the house. The garden gate is at the back. Pretty much, though you' need a little ladder to get into the trees. The steepest bit is on the way up, so you could probably walk most of it.",
